          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe Yohaana mwene wanyu, anyakubagana na inywe omu Yesu: emihito n'okugumiisiriza ebitutungisa obukama, nkaba ndi omu kizinga ekirukwetwa Patimo, nkwatirweyo habw'okurangirra ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'okumanyisa abantu ebya Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro kya Mukama, obu natemberwe Mwoyo, enyuma yange nahurra iraka likooto nk'ery'engwara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nirigamba liti: “Ebi orukurora bihandiike omu kitabu, obitwekere ebitebe musanju by'abaikiriza abali: Efeeso, Sumiruna, Perugamo, Tiyatiira, Saadisi, Filadelufiya na Layodikeeya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
